              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seiko zvakadaro? Nokuti havana kuutevera nokutenda asi sokunge namabasa avo. Vakagumburwa neibwe \"rinogumbusa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
